**Albanese addressed the National Press Club.<ref>{{citation |title=IN FULL: Anthony Albanese announces plan to cut spending on two grant programs {{!}} ABC News |url=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TMVZR610tZ8 |access-date=2022-05-18}}</ref> Morrison is the first prime minister since 1969 not to address the National Press Club in the final week of an election campaign.<ref>{{cite web |last=Brook |first=Samantha Hutchinson, Stephen |date=15 May 2022 |title=Morrison gives the shrug to the National Press Club |url=https://www.smh.com.au/national/morrison-gives-the-shrug-to-the-national-press-club-20220515-p5alij.html |access-date=2022-05-18 |website=The Sydney Morning Herald}}</ref>
